# P102 on GtkBackend on macOS (TEST_BACKEND=gtk4): longPressTextSelection() in a TextField and a TextEditor, and not in a plain TextField.
# Positions from the GTK window on 2026-10-17 (880x1096 px = 440x548 pt at 2x; origin=frame, 28 pt title bar):
# FIELD text at frame y 185, EDITOR lines at y 247/262/277, CONTROL at y 403.
# Pass (p102-select.log): FIELD began with an empty range then ended forward and non-empty; EDITOR ended backward;
# no line at all for the CONTROL press or for the quick FIELD drag at the end (held 0.1 s: GtkText's own drag-select).
# P102 在 GtkBackend(macOS)上：長按後拖曳。通過條件:FIELD 先以空範圍 began、再以非空的正向範圍 ended;EDITOR ended 為 backward;
# CONTROL 的長按與最後那次快速拖曳(只按 0.1 秒，交給 GtkText 自己的拖曳選取)都不能有任何一行。
sleep,,,,,,1500000,let P102 lay out,macos
mousedown,60,185,frame,left,,,FIELD: press on 'quick',macos
sleep,,,,,,800000,hold past the 0.5 s long-press delay,macos
move,100,185,frame,,,,drag right,macos
sleep,,,,,,100000,,macos
move,150,185,frame,,,,drag right,macos
sleep,,,,,,100000,,macos
move,200,185,frame,,,,drag right,macos
sleep,,,,,,150000,,macos
mouseup,200,185,frame,left,,,let go -- the selection stays,macos
sleep,,,,,,1000000,,macos
mousedown,150,277,frame,left,,,EDITOR: press on the third line,macos
sleep,,,,,,800000,hold,macos
